      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "On every beat and bass hit, the characters dance with sharp, powerful, rhythmic movements, snapping their heads, shoulders, arms and bodies perfectly to the music. Neon waveforms pulse and ripple to the beat, speaker cones vibrate with heavy bass, equalizer bars bounce rapidly, analog VU meters swing, and retro stereo lights flash in sync. Intense pink, purple and cyan rave lighting strobes rhythmically. High-energy anime dance animation, fluid motion with sharp accents, dynamic hair and clothing movement. Static camera, fixed composition, no camera movement, no cuts, no text. 16:9."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "On every beat and bass hit, the characters dance with sharp, powerful, rhythmic movements, snapping their heads, shoulders, arms and bodies perfectly to the music. Neon waveforms pulse and ripple to the beat, speaker cones vibrate with heavy bass, equalizer bars bounce rapidly, analog VU meters swing, and retro stereo lights flash in sync. Intense pink, purple and cyan rave lighting strobes rhythmically. High-energy anime dance animation, fluid motion with sharp accents, dynamic hair and clothing movement. Static camera, fixed composition, no camera movement, no cuts, no text. 16:9."
